"National Bank of Poland, Bank of Russia, Central Bank of Turkey, Reserve "
"Bank of Australia, Central Bank of Brazil, HMRC) need no API key; cross-"
"rates are derived into the company currency. Aggregator sources serve broad "
"coverage; some need an API key. Manual disables automatic fetch so finance "
"enters rates by hand."
msgstr ""
